+
+### Used construct map
+
+| Submitted construct | Declaration | Governing execution |
+|---|---|---|
+| `Module`, `FuncDef`, `Params`, statement lists | `syntax.k:53-61` | `core.k:124-127`, `functions.k:14-16` |
